#: wizard.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgid "Nepomuk Data Migration"
msgstr "Nepomuk-Datenöverföhren"

#: wizard.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this new release Nepomuk has migrated its internal data format. You "
"have launched this wizard because you wish to migrate your data and not go "
"with the recommended method of backup and restore. This migration can take "
"several hours"
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Utgaav hett Nepomuk een nieg Datenformaat. Du hest dissen Hölper "
"anmaakt, wiel Du Dien Daten överföhren un de anraadte Metood - sekern un "
"wedderherstellen - nich bruken wullt. Dat Överföhren mag en poor Stünnen "
"bruken."

#: wizard.cpp:107
#, kde-format
msgid "The internal data is being migrated"
msgstr "De internen Daten warrt överföhrt"

#: wizard.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid "This process could take a while"
msgstr "Dat mag nu en Stoot bruken"

#: wizard.cpp:158
#, kde-format
msgid "Data has been successfully migrated"
msgstr "De Daten wöörn mit Spood överföhrt"
